    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "2-3 gallons sounds like a lot though... they are already feeling kind of sick to their stomach. if i give them the metformin and make them drink all that water, how long should i wait before i actually call a doctor? i don't want to waste money on an ER visit if this is just something we can fix here.",
